CST-DUST: kontinuierlicher Vier-Element-Sektor v0.1
X6 / Thomas Gfeller research working package, 2026-11-07.
Based on the Apache-2.0 repository thomasmgfeller/x6-spectral-astrolabium,
commit e4787d04c78a1da43825dbbac670a0e3dfacee51.
Twelve source identities are pinned in inputs/provenance.json.
External references are linked, not redistributed.
Continuous fields are integrated through n=4 in a conditional reference model.
Higher-number field phases are bounded by norm mass, not evaluated.
The checked native kernel requires g++ with __int128 and overflow builtins.
No physical density prior, detector, boundary, 4D dynamics, bounce or junction
is selected or derived. All eight physical gates remain HOLD.
